Language English

Book Library Ordered No Keep Looped

	Page ExploreLibraryViaStudy
		Triggered By @ExploreLibraryViaStudy
		
		Prolog "This door has a small brass plaque that reads <<Library.>>"
		Button "Explore"
		
		Add TokenWallLibrary!
		Remove TokenExploreLibraryViaStudy

		Text """
			The door opens and the taste of fresh air surprises you. You feel a
			draft, but cannot tell where it is coming from. Place a wall as
			indicated, then discard this Explore token.
		"""
		
		exploredLibary = true
		exploredLibraryViaStudy = true
		$mythosLibrary = true 
		wandererInStudy = true
	End Page ExploreLibraryViaStudy

	Page SpawnCultist No Text
		Spawn SpawnLibraryCultist
		Exit
	End Page SpawnCultist
	
	Page PlaceKey
		Triggered By @DefeatedCustomMonsterLibraryCultist
		
		Add TokenSearchLibraryKey!

		Text """
			The man in robes lies at your feet; blood pools on the floor and
			soaks into the rug. Breathing hard and wondering what just
			happened, you chuckle darkly at how the mess here is getting worse.

			When the man got up earlier, something fell out of his pocket.
			Place a Search token as indicated.
		"""
	End Page PlaceKey
	
	Page PlaceSearchBookCase
		Add TokenSearchLibraryBookcase!

		Text """
			A bookcase on the far wall is filled from floor to ceiling with
			books. Maybe one of them can help you understand what is happening?
			Place a Search token as indicated.
		"""
		
		Exit
	End Page PlaceSearchBookCase
	
	Page SearchKey
		Not Visible
		Triggered By @SearchLibraryKey
		
		Prolog "It looks like the man dropped his key ring."
		Button "Pick up keys"
		
		Add QItemKey
		Remove TokenSearchLibraryKey

		Text QItemKey """
			You reach down to pick up the keys. You’re impressed by the number
			and variety. Some of the keys have strange symbols on their bows
			while others have beautiful and intricate blades. You pocket them
			and wonder if you'll need them. Gain the {c:QItemKey} Unique Item,
			then discard this Search token.
		"""
		
		foundKey = true
		Exit
	End Page SearchKey
	
	Page SearchBookcase
		Not Visible
		Triggered By @SearchLibraryBookcase When Unread
		
		Prolog """
			The books seem like a hodgepodge of local history, religion, and
			dark magic. After killing that man, you're understandably upset.
			You came here to clean this house and now you're in way over your
			head--murder, ghosts, magic. As you ponder this, you see a book
			with a bright, white spine that stands out among the other, darker
			books.
		"""
		Button "Search"
		
		Text """
			You reach up to get the book but it doesn't move. You reach
			directly in front of you and try another and it comes right out.
			You decide to try a little harder ({strength};2).
		"""
		
		Test "Pass" Or "Fail" Set passSearchBookcase
		If passSearchBookcase Then Goto SearchBookcasePass
		Goto SearchBookcaseFail
	End Page SearchBookcase
	
	Page SearchBookcaseFail
		Not Visible
		Text "It just won't budge. Maybe if you try a little harder."
		Exit
	End Page SearchBookcaseFail
	
	Page SearchBookcaseAgain
		Not Visible
		Triggered By @SearchLibraryBookcase When SearchBookcase Is Read
		
		Prolog "The book wouldn't move, but maybe it will this time..."
		Button "Try again"
		
		Text """
			You reach up again, grab the book and pull as hard as
			you can ({stregth;2}).
		"""
		
		Test "Pass" Or "Fail" Set passSearchBookcase
		If Not passSearchBookcase Then Goto SearchBookcaseFail
		Goto SearchBookcasePass
	End Page SearchBookcaseAgain
	
	Page SearchBookcasePass
		Not Visible
		
		Remove TokenSearchLibraryBookcase

		Text """
			The book rains dust onto you when it finally comes loose. It still
			doesn't come out all the way, but you realize it is part of a lock
			for a secret door. Discard this Search token.
		"""
		
		Goto PlaceBookcaseExplore
	End Page SearchBookcasePass
		
	Page PlaceBookcaseExplore
		Not Visible
		
		Add TokenLibraryTrapDoor, TokenExploreChapelViaLibrary!

		Text """
			You pull on the bookcase and it swings out with a creak. Behind it
			is a door with an elaborate lock. What was old Mr Smythe up to?

			Place a trap door and an Explore token as indicated.
		"""
	
		Exit
	End Page PlaceBookcaseExplore
	
	Page ExploreChapelViaBookcase
		Not Visible
		
		Triggered By @ExploreChapelViaBookcase When Unread
		
		Text """
			There is an elaborate lock on the door behind the bookcase; it has
			arcane markings, ones that you recognize from the spine of one of
			the books. An investigator with a heavy weapon might be able to
			bust through the door; otherwise, maybe the lock could be picked?
		"""

		Test "Attempt the puzzle using {lore}" Or "Smash the door with a heavy weapon" Set puzzleForBookcase
		If Not puzzleForBookcase Then Goto ExploreChapelViaBookcaseSmash
		Trigger @PuzzleBookcaseLock
	End Page ExploreChapelViaBookcase
	
	Page ExploreChapelViaBookcaseSmash
		Not Visible 
		Text """
			You raise your heavy weapon and swing. Roll 1 fewer die if you have
			suffered 3 or more Damage. ({strength};2) Deal damage equal to the
			weapon's damage.
		"""
		
		Test Quota 5 Set passSmashBookcase
		If passSmashBookcase Then Goto SmashPass
		Goto SmashFail
	End Page ExploreChapelViaBookcaseSmash
	
	Page SmashFail
		Not Visible
		Text "No done"
		Exit
	End Page SmashFail
	
	Page SmashPass
		Not Visible
		Text "Not done (2)"
		Exit
	End Page SmashPass	
End Book Library	